#: backend.cpp:662
msgid "Jack Audio Connection Kit"
msgstr "Jack Audio Connection Kit"

#: backend.cpp:663
msgid ""
"<html><p>JACK is a low-latency audio server. It can connect a number of "
"different applications to an audio device, as well as allowing them to share "
"audio between themselves.</p><p>JACK was designed from the ground up for "
"professional audio work, and its design focuses on two key areas: "
"synchronous execution of all clients, and low latency operation.</p></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><p>JACK je serwera krótczégò òpózdzeniô. Mòże pòłączëc wiele różnëch "
"aplikacëjów do ùrządzenia aùdio, a téż pòzwôlec jima na wespółdzelenié zwãkù "
"midze nima.</p><p>JACK òstôł zaprojektowóny òd zaczątkù dlô profesjonalny "
"robòtë nad zwãkã a jegò dbą je dzejanié w dwóch wôżnëch môlach: "
"synchronikòwô robòta wszëtczéch klientów a krótczé òpózdzenia.</p></html>"

